# The Wisdom of Elders (bastok 36): Benita and Tete in Port Bastok. The offer (174), Tete's 175 (importantOnce: Prog
# set to 1 the first time, left at 1 after), the bomb ash trade, the Traveler's Hat reward, no repeat. Benita's own
# script answers her trigger outside the offer (102 or 103 at random) and has no onTrade; Tete's default is 35. No
# other quest names either.
lists PortBastok/Benita/onTrigger PortBastok/Benita/onTrade PortBastok/Tete/onTrigger PortBastok/onEventFinish/174 PortBastok/onEventFinish/175 PortBastok/onEventFinish/176
char zone=PortBastok pos=49.7,-4.771,37.2
item PinchOfBombAsh x3
item BoneChip
login
trade Benita PinchOfBombAsh x1  # available: no trade handler, her script has none: nothing
trigger Tete                    # available: his default 35
finish
trigger Benita                  # the offer, 174
finish                          # accepted
trigger Benita                  # accepted: her script, 102 or 103 at random (102 here)
finish
trigger Tete                    # accepted: 175 (importantOnce)
finish                          # Prog 0: Prog set to 1
trigger Tete                    # 175 once performed drops to Default priority: his default 35 wins
finish
rezone                          # the action's priority var is cleared on zoning
trigger Tete                    # 175 again
finish                          # Prog already 1: no change
walk 49.7,-4.771,37.2           # back to Benita (a trade does not walk to the NPC)
trade Benita BoneChip x1        # the wrong item: nothing
trade Benita PinchOfBombAsh x1  # 176
finish                          # completed: Traveler's Hat, fame +20, an ash gone, the Prog var cleared
trigger Tete                    # completed: 35
finish
walk 49.7,-4.771,37.2
trade Benita PinchOfBombAsh x1  # completed: nothing
trigger Benita                  # completed: her script (102 here)
finish
